# Korriban, the landing and the Valley of Dark Lords (TSL, 003EBO, 701KOR,
# to 710KOR): the galaxy map to Korriban, the landing talk aboard (Kreia
# asked what happened here and whether Sith live on it; she will not walk
# Korriban's surface and keeps the engines primed, no -INF), ashore with
# Atton and Bao-Dur (Kreia cannot be picked: 701KOR's OnEnter takes her
# selectability away), the intro walk off the ramp with Kreia's voice over
# the plundered tombs; down the valley, Kreia's history at each tomb and
# the excavation, her warning on the corpses, the skeletal corpses searched
# and their Hssiss fought; the party's banter at the shyrack cave's mouth,
# Kreia's word that the Exile is strong enough, the two shyracks that come
# out, and into the cave.
# Starts from Onderon's first visit, the Ebon Hawk at Dxun:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_first_done data/routes/tsl/korriban_valley.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Korriban" and "Valley of the Dark Lords"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/): DSimpson's order, the cave and the secret
# tomb before the Academy (the tomb asks a level over 9, sec_tomb's
# c_global_gt G_PC_LEVEL 9; the chain's Exile lands at 14).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Atton (NPC 0) and Bao-Dur (NPC 1) are in the party table and selectable,
#   Korriban open on the galaxy map (planetary.2da row 3).
# - The party waits together before each banter trigger (`gather`): the
#   companions' lines ask them within 10 m (c_con_*pm).
use Galaxymap
travel 3             # Korriban (planetary.2da)
say What happened here? # kor_int: the landing talk, Kreia asked about Korriban
say Do you think there are any living Sith here?
say Let's head out, then.
say Why won't you come with me?
say Korriban doesn't look that bad. I'm not afraid.
say Very well. Stay here and keep the engines primed # (not "Fine. I didn't want your company anyway", -INF)
talk
party 0,1            # Atton and Bao-Dur (Kreia is unselectable on Korriban)
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen, accepted
module 701kor
talk                 # tr_intro: Kreia's voice as the party walks off the ramp (kreia_kr)
# Kreia's histories at the tombs (tr_hist_*, kreia_kr starts 1-5: "Tell me
# more." and the questions after, never "Enough with the history. Be
# silent.", -INF), her word on the corpses (corpse_warn, start 6) and the
# skeletal corpses searched (corpse_tr_hss*: each calls two cloaked Hssiss,
# kreia_kr start 7 the first time: "What are these guardians?", not "These
# creatures shouldn't be much challenge.", -INF). The first reply each
# time is the one taken.
to tr_hist_sadow     # Naga Sadow's tomb
talk
to tr_hist_hord      # Tulak Hord's
talk
to corpse_warn@1     # Kreia on the corpses (start 6), heard before one is searched
talk
use corpse_tr_hssiss
talk
fight 20
use corpse_tr_hss001
fight 20
use corpse_tr_hss002
fight 20
use corpse_tr_hss003
fight 20
to tr_hist_pall      # Ajunta Pall's: "[Awareness] You sound like you disapprove.",
talk                 # "No one is beneath redemption, Kreia. No one." (LSP, +INF)
to tr_hist_ragnos    # Marka Ragnos's
talk
use corpse_tr_hss004
fight 20
to tr_hist_excav     # the excavation
talk
use corpse_tr_hss005
fight 20
use corpse_tr_hss006
fight 20
to 74,72             # short of the cave's mouth: the party together for its banter
gather
to tr_cave_banter    # the party at the cave's mouth, Kreia's advice (kreia_cv)
talk
fight 20             # the two shyracks her scene spawns (tr_shyrak, sp_g_shyrack)
exit To_710          # the Shyrack Cave
module 710kor
save korriban_cave
